WEBVTT

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:07.341
Full-time employees see a timecard that fills itself every Monday from their standard schedule.

00:00:07.341 --> 00:00:12.117
If the hours differ, they edit the blocks that are wrong, or add extra hours.

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:17.371
Interns and part-time employees start with an empty timecard.

00:00:17.371 --> 00:00:20.827
They create their own time blocks for each pay period.

00:00:22.177 --> 00:00:24.599
Employees submit when the hours match.

00:00:24.599 --> 00:00:29.571
If they worked overtime or the schedule changed, they edit before they submit.

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:32.886
Later adjustments are allowed for up to ninety days.

00:00:34.236 --> 00:00:41.911
If an employee books time off after the week was auto-populated, they delete the conflicting Hours Worked entries.

00:00:41.911 --> 00:00:46.018
Combined daily recorded time cannot exceed the scheduled day.

00:00:46.018 --> 00:00:47.633
The standard is 8 hours.

00:00:48.983 --> 00:00:51.822
You manage on-call eligibility in Workday.

00:00:51.822 --> 00:00:58.242
Once an employee is eligible, they record on-call time in the on-call sections of the timecard.
